---@field deployment_name string Deployment Name
---@field reference? string|distilled.Null The reference of the deployment. When provided, must match the following rules: - be unique across deployment references in the project - 3 to 100 characters (included) - only lowercase letters, numbers, "-"" and "/" - not follow the deployment name format [a-z]+-[a-z]+-[0-9]+ (e.g. "happy-capybara-123") - not start with "local-"" - not be one of the following reserved keywords: "prod", "dev", "cloud", "local", "default", "name", "new", "existing", "deployment", "preview"
